      "text": "凡俗的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 483369,
      "end_ms": 484869,
      "text": "或者说是形而下的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 484869,
      "end_ms": 486680,
      "text": "形而下的形而上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 486680,
      "end_ms": 487880,
      "text": "这里这里是形而上的"
