      "end_ms": 705860,
      "text": "心很静"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 705860,
      "end_ms": 710510,
      "text": "然后思虑完全就是停息的那么一种观察者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 710510,
      "end_ms": 712410,
      "text": "笛卡尔也是沃斯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 712410,
      "end_ms": 714579,
      "text": "是个绝对虚无的一个沃斯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 715340,
      "end_ms": 720740,
      "text": "那么这个我们就是讲了那个二杠二杠三啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 720740,
      "end_ms": 721730,
      "text": "二杠三"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 721730,
      "end_ms": 723040,
      "text": "所以这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 725640,
      "end_ms": 727740,
      "text": "那就讲到这边就讲到这边啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 727740,
      "end_ms": 729300,
      "text": "这个二杠三就讲到这里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 729300,
